WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.867 --> 00:00:08.387
If you're a teacher buying a license for yourself, this video shows you how to check out, and how to get to your lessons afterward.

2
00:00:08.888 --> 00:00:24.848
On the licenses page, each plan has a card. The Per Educator plan gives one teacher full access to the lessons, quizzes, and answer keys. Buying for a whole school or district? Use the link under the heading to request a group proposal instead.

3
00:00:25.349 --> 00:00:32.439
First, type the email address you want your purchase linked to. Use the same address you'll sign in with.

4
00:00:32.941 --> 00:00:38.781
Choose how many seats. For yourself, that's one. The total updates as you change it.

5
00:00:39.283 --> 00:00:51.073
Select Buy Now. You're taken to Stripe's secure payment page to enter your card. We never see your card number. This video doesn't show that page, to keep card details private.

6
00:00:51.574 --> 00:01:04.764
When your payment goes through, Stripe sends you back here with a green message, Payment received. Your license is waiting. To activate it, create an account, or log in, with the same email you checked out with.

7
00:01:05.264 --> 00:01:12.074
Enter your name, the same email, and a password with at least eight characters, and select Sign Up.

8
00:01:12.575 --> 00:01:19.475
We send you an email to confirm your address. Select the link inside. It works for twenty four hours.

9
00:01:19.977 --> 00:01:24.287
Now sign in on the Teacher Login page with your email and password.

10
00:01:25.727 --> 00:01:32.167
Open My Licenses, from the account menu. Your license is listed here, with its status and dates.

11
00:01:32.668 --> 00:01:39.698
The green banner at the top is your next step: build your lesson plan library. The next video shows you how.
